# Spectre's output is not published (Cadence NDA, confirmed by the author 2026-11-14): its result
# files (PSF), their logFile indexes, its logs, the run summaries and environment files all stay
# on the machine that holds them. What is tracked here is ours: the translated netlists (*.scs) and
# the READMEs. Comparisons of verilog-a-sim's accuracy against these files may be published;
# numbers comparing speed or memory with Spectre may not (qualitative wording only).
*
!*/
!*.scs
!README.md
!.gitignore
